            <tr><td class="text-muted">Confirmed Listed At</td><td><?= $pd['listed_at'] ? e(date('d M Y H:i', strtotime($pd['listed_at']))) : '—' ?></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="text-muted small mt-2 mb-0">Submitted via Creditinfo's own User Interface -- no REST API exists for Public Defaults (vendor-confirmed). SFTP: Specification Awaiting Creditinfo Documentation.</p>
